'''Camo Toilet''' is a secret [[Enemies|enemy]] that can only be spawned by admins and spawns in the Easy Drill Mode with 3500 health, and when spawned it has a base health of 51.

== Trivia ==

* The Camo Toilet was discovered by a Youtuber Name '''manofTaj'''.
* The Camo Toilet was inspired from the '''Camo Toilet''' from the original series, either the ones in 18th episode or 32.[https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Camo_Skibidi_Toilet?so=search]
